      "text": " B.\n</think>\n\nLet's analyze the problem step by step.\n\n**Context:**\n1. **Xiao Wang** dialed the phone of **everyone** in the administrative department.\n2. **Xiao Li** once called **Xiao Zhao**, but **Xiao Zhao** never called anyone else.\n3. People who have **never answered calls** from others in the administration department have **never called others**.\n\n**Question:** Based on the above information, which of the following can be inferred?\n\n**Options:**\n- **A)** Xiao Zhao never answered a phone call from Xiao Li\n- **B)** Xiao Li once answered a phone call from Xiao Wang\n- **C)** Someone in the administration department once called Xiao Wang\n- **D)** Xiao Wang answered the phone from everyone in the administration department\n\n**Analysis:**\n\n1. **Understanding the Statements:**\n   - **Xiao Wang** called **everyone** in the department, meaning he made calls to all members.\n   - **Xiao Li** called **Xiao Zhao**, but **Xiao Zhao** did not call anyone else.\n   - People who have **never answered** calls from others have **never called** others.\n\n2. **Interpreting the Statements:**\n   - Since **Xiao Wang** called everyone, **Xiao Wang** must have received calls from **Xiao Wang** himself.\n   - **Xiao Li** called **Xiao Zhao**, so **Xiao Zhao** received a call from **Xiao Li**.\n   - **Xiao Zhao** did not call anyone else, so **Xiao Zhao** has never answered calls from others except **Xiao Li**.\n\n3. **Evaluating the Options:**\n   - **A)** **Xiao Zhao never answered a phone call from Xiao Li**: This is incorrect because **Xiao Zhao** did receive a call from **Xiao Li**.\n   - **B)** **Xiao Li once answered a phone call from Xiao Wang**: This is incorrect because **Xiao Li** called **Xiao Zhao**, not the other way around.\n   - **C)** **Someone in the administration department once called Xiao Wang**: This is incorrect because **Xiao Wang** called everyone, so no one else called **Xiao Wang**.\n   - **D)** **Xiao Wang answered the phone from everyone in the administration department**: This is incorrect because **Xiao Wang** dialed everyone, meaning he called them, not that he answered calls from them.\n\n**Conclusion:** None of the options can be inferred from the given context.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{None of the options can be inferred.}}",
