messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nOnly when all countries in the world recognize the need to respect the sovereignty of any country and truly implement this treaty can the world be truly peaceful. However, because some countries hold a hegemonic attitude and adopt dual principles towards their own countries and other countries, they do not respect the sovereignty of some countries.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, thus which of the followings can be seen?\n# Options:\nA) Every country should respect the sovereignty of other countries\nB) At present, the world has achieved real peace\nC) A country with a hegemonic attitude is shameful\nD) At present, there is no real peace in the world', '<think></think>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
