messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nWith the gradual implementation of macroeconomic control policies, my country's economic growth will moderately slow down, the demand for oil and natural gas resources will decrease, and the contradiction between supply and demand will be eased to a certain extent. According to the latest forecast of the International Energy Agency, my country's crude oil will be eased this year. Production will reach 175 million tons, an increase of 1% over last year; while crude oil consumption will likely exceed 300 million tons, an increase of about 12% over last year; imports will exceed 100 million tons, possibly close to 120 million tons, an increase over last year Around 30%.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options can be inferred from this text?\n# Options:\nA) My country's crude oil supply is tight\nB) My country's crude oil consumption mainly depends on imports\nC) My country's dependence on imported crude oil has increased\nD) My country's demand for energy will become less and less", '<think></think>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
