messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nA public good, also known as a public good, is a non - exclusive item or service.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following is public good?\n# Options:\nA) Social security\nB) Affordable housing\nC) Expressway\nD) Herdsman's meadows", '<think></think>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
