messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nA, B, C, D and E are on duty. Each person is on duty for one day from Monday to Friday. Requirements: B is in front of D and E, and C cannot be on Tuesday. There is exactly one day between A and D.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, ask B is on duty what time of week is the five people on duty unique?\n# Options:\nA) Monday\nB) Tuseday\nC) Wednesday\nD) Thursday', '<think></think>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
