in Sales or Public Relations.\n     - If G is in Sales, it's possible.\n   - **Option B:** H is in Production.\n     - H must be in the same department as Y.\n     - If H is in Production, Y must also be in Production.\n     - Possible.\n   - **Option C:** I is in Sales.\n     - I can be in Sales, as there's no restriction on I.\n   - **Option D:** W is in Public Relations.\n     - W can be in any department since X is in Production (Condition 3 doesn't restrict W).\n     - Possible.\n\n8. **Conclusion:**\n   - All options are possible except **Option D**, as W can be in Public Relations.\n\n---\n\n### **Final Answer:**\n\\boxed{D}",
