messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nOnly by adhering to the scientific outlook on development can we achieve sustainable development. We must achieve sustainable development for the sake of future generations.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following can be inferred?\n# Options:\nA) We must increase publicity.\nB) Sustainable development must be combined with scientific management.\nC) For the sake of future generations, we must adhere the scientific outlook on development.\nD) As long as we adhere the scientific outlook on development, we will surely achieve sustainable development.', '<think></think>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
